The Recorder;
The City Marshal, on one of Willie Clarkson's hobby-horses;
The Worshipful Company of Street-Sweepers;
The City Hangman, with gallows;
The Senior Alderman, with an escort of three bushing youths;
The Governor of the Bank of England, with a Jew nose and pawnbroker's sign;
City Fire Bug, with hose, etc.; 
The City Ratcatcher, with a mousetrap.

Rate, 12 words 1s, (minimum): 1d, per word after.

BURNEMOUTH.-Hotel Empress now open; electric lift; faces beautiful garden; south aspect; billiards; phone, 1,576. (Clark, late Ifracombe.)

CREATE YARMOUTH.-Garibaldi Hotel, for gentlemen;
